  "result": "I added `slugify` in `src/cli/slug.ts` and committed it as `2c21fb7`.\n\nIt lowercases the text and strips accents using Unicode NFKD normalization. It then splits on any run of non-letter, non-digit characters and joins the words with single hyphens. Leading and trailing separators are dropped, and input with no words returns an empty string.\n\nThe tests are in `test/cli/slug.test.ts` and cover basic joining, accent stripping, collapsing separators and trimming, and the empty result. All 4 pass, and `biome check` and `tsc --noEmit` report no problems. I didn't run the full `npm test` suite.\n\nNFKD doesn't decompose a few letters, such as `ł`, so `slugify` leaves them as they are. The accent test expects `zazołc` for that reason.",
